  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The incident occurred at the Darul Ma'arif Mosque in the Pondok Kelapa area of East Jakarta, where three congregants were attacked following dawn prayers. Authorities detained an individual, identified by his initials FP, who was recorded on security cameras entering the site carrying a suitcase and cardboard before the confrontation took place. Following his apprehension, the suspect issued an apology and expressed regret for the event. The Jakarta Metropolitan Police are currently leading the investigation and have requested that the public remain calm and avoid being provoked by the incident. Officials from the Ministry of Religious Affairs have formally condemned the assault, emphasizing that the case is being handled professionally by local authorities. Investigations into the specific motives behind the attack remain ongoing as police work to establish the circumstances surrounding the disruption of the religious service.",
